# Agentic Template (stack-agnostic)

Document the toolchain in AGENT_HANDOFF.md and TEST_PLAN.md. Variants add **5–10 lines of project invariants** below a short header. **Do not recopy hard rules into this file.**

**Tracked truth:** PM_PLAN.md, AGENT_HANDOFF.md, TEST_PLAN.md, TECH_DEBT.md, RISKS.md, RELEASE.md, INCIDENTS.md, doc/PROJECT_STATUS.md. Skills in `.cursor/skills/` — do not rename skill titles on upstream merge.

## Hard rules (one file each — read those)

| Failure mode | Rule |
|--------------|------|
| Next story while current is uncommitted / waiting on a human | `one-story-one-ship.mdc` |
| Cursor commit/PR attribution | `no-cursor-commit-attribution.mdc` |
| Tiers, evidence logs, harvest into tests | `testing.mdc` + `TEST_TDD.md` |
| Handoff / epic close | `handoff-checklist.mdc`, `epic-close.mdc` |
| Gemini drop | `gemini-handoff.mdc` |
| Branch / commit / push | `github-feature-workflow` skill + AGENT_HANDOFF Git workflow |

**Variant authors:** keep this index. Put stack paths, product invariants, and install/smoke overlays in *their* always.mdc / extra rules — not here.
